/generated/prisma

# Auto-installed by `prisma init` (AI agent doc skills) — not part of the project.
# .claude/ itself is committed (kit guards, skills, profile): a clone must be a working
# project. Only the prisma symlinks — they point into the ignored .agents/ and would
# dangle on a fresh clone — and machine-local settings stay out.
.claude/skills/prisma-*
.claude/settings.local.json
.windsurf/
.agents/
skills-lock.json

.env*
# ...but the template carries no secrets, and README tells you to copy it.
!.env.example
